flowchart LR
  learner["You<br/>submit a Ray Job"]
  anyscale["Anyscale control plane<br/>records the job"]
  operator["Operator in AKS<br/>polls Anyscale outbound"]
  kubernetes["Kubernetes API and scheduler<br/>create and place the pods"]
  result["You see<br/>job result and pod placement"]

  learner --> anyscale
  operator -->|polls for pending work| anyscale
  operator --> kubernetes --> result

  classDef person fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#451a03,font-size:20px
  classDef service fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0369a1,color:#082f49,font-size:20px
  classDef result fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#052e16,font-size:20px
  class learner person
  class anyscale,operator,kubernetes service
  class result result
